        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?ARCHIVE=&method=ReplyQuote&REPLY_ID=48873&TOPIC_ID=7917&FORUM_ID=14&CAT_ID=6&Forum_Title=New+Adventures+%2D+General+Board&Topic_Title=CoH%3A+Trick+or+Treat%21&M="><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Statesman posted this on the forums about this event:</P><P><BLOCKQUOTE id=quote><font size=1 face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" id=quote>quote:<hr height=1 noshade id=quote>A big thank you...</P><P>To all those who helped test the "Trick or Treat" portion of our Halloween event.</P><P>And don't worry - it'll be available in ALL City Zones and ALL levels.</P><P>BTW, we've got another "trick" up our sleeve for Halloween. MMMMWWWAAAHHAAAAHHAAAA.<hr height=1 noshade id=quote></BLOCKQUOTE id=quote></font id=quote><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size=2 id=quote></P><P>He seems to really -enjoy- this game. <img src=icon_smile_big.gif border=0 align=middle></P><P>Brax</P><P></P><P><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
