        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> First, here was the crowd in Atlas Park-1 (there were at least six, maybe eight instances running):</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/HalloweenEventCrowd.jpg" border=0></P><P>I only saw these Witches after someone had defeated them.  New hat, spiney-skirt and spiney-short cloak.</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/HalloweenWitches.jpg" border=0></P><P>Here's pumpkinhead:</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/HalloweenPumpkinHead.jpg" border=0></P><P>And zombies:</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/HaloweenZombies.jpg" border=0></P><P>Never saw the werewolves or vampires...</P><P>Brax</P><P>EDIT: Mis-spelled Halloween on the zombie pic - fixed. <img src=icon_smile.gif border=0 align=middle></P><P></P><P>Edited by - Braxzana on 10/27/2004  23:19:56<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
