        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Here's some pics from the REAL Halloween event, on the live servers:</P><P>This is a Sorceress, trapped in a temp-power my katana scrapper used (designed for the Lost, but worked fine on these folk):</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/Halloween_Witch.jpg" border=0></P><P>Here's a vampire in the same Hold:</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/Halloween_Vampire.jpg" border=0></P><P>And here's a werewolf --- note how WIDE the force-field holding him is: his body type is huge.</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/Halloween_Werewolf.jpg" border=0></P><P>This wasn't strictly speaking a Halloween event, but was a cool spooky shot of a Spectral Demon Lord:</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/SpectralDemonLord.jpg" border=0></P><P>Here's one of the "Pumpkin King" monsters (Eochoi) climbing a fire escape:</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/Eochoi_Fire_Escape.jpg" border=0></P><P>And here's some poor tanker being swamped by three Eochoi (he's in the middle of that pack of Streng's to the left).</P><P><img src="http://home.comcast.net/~sorpaijen/Eochoi_Gang.jpg" border=0></P><P>Brax</P><P></P><P><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
